(7676911, 1254999, 67145, '<td valign="top">this would have to be the best stinkbug photo i''ve ever seen ... <br/>however the only stinkbug photos i''ve seen are ones i''ve taken myself .. ;) .. and mine dont even come close to the awesomeness of this one .. <br/>i have a feeling i know who took this .. and i want to know what equipment you are using ... when it comes to macro photography .. especially of this calibre .. you really do have to be exceptionally talented but you also need dedicated macro equipment .. <br/>i''m not voting yet .. i''ll be back .. :)</td>', 'this would have to be the best stinkbug photo i''ve ever seen ... however the only stinkbug photos i''ve seen are ones i''ve taken myself .. ;) .. and mine dont even come close to the awesomeness of this one .. i have a feeling i know who took this .. and i want to know what equipment you are using ... when it comes to macro photography .. especially of this calibre .. you really do have to be exceptionally talented but you also need dedicated macro equipment .. i''m not voting yet .. i''ll be back .. :)', '2020-10-16 02:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
