(7677544, 1254930, 138630, '<td valign="top">Ever since I saw a movie about how flies carry germs that showed one landing on dog-doo and then on food on a picnic table (of course leaving dog-doo behind), I''ve hated these creatures.  But this is a splendid capture and, as Lydia says, the tones are gorgeous.  Congratulations on the ribbon.</td>', 'Ever since I saw a movie about how flies carry germs that showed one landing on dog-doo and then on food on a picnic table (of course leaving dog-doo behind), I''ve hated these creatures.  But this is a splendid capture and, as Lydia says, the tones are gorgeous.  Congratulations on the ribbon.', '2020-10-23 01:31:47.000000', NULL, 0),
