(7677577, 1254930, 52549, '<td valign="top">Another fantastic shot, Roz. I only once did a shot of a fly in July 2010 and a voter thought I was you. Great compliment for me.<br/>I love your work. Many congrats on your ribbon.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2020-10-23 11:07:26.</i></td>', 'Another fantastic shot, Roz. I only once did a shot of a fly in July 2010 and a voter thought I was you. Great compliment for me.I love your work. Many congrats on your ribbon.', '2020-10-23 11:18:33.000000', '2020-10-23 12:07:26.000000', 0),
